{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45933","headline":"送姚洎拾遗自江陵幕赴京 · 贯休","name":"送姚洎拾遗自江陵幕赴京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捧诏动征轮，分飞楚水滨。\n由来真庙器，多作伏蒲人。\n舍鲁知非愿，朝天不话贫。\n沙头千骑送，岛上一蝉新。\n莫使身侵贵，无矜贵逼身。\n玉阶凝正色，兰苑涨芳尘。\n銮辂方离华，车书渐似秦。\n流年飘儵忽，书札莫因循。\n凉雨鸣红叶，非烟闭紫宸。\n凭将西社意，一说向荀陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}